<title>FINLAND: Nokia '96 sales, profit by business group.</title>
<headline>Nokia '96 sales, profit by business group.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown by business group of its 1996 net sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p> Net sales				    1996	     1995</p>
<p> Telecommunications		     13,333	   10,341</p>
<p> Mobile Phones			    21,579	   16,052</p>
<p> Other operations			  5,197	   11,156</p>
<p> Intra-group eliminations		 -788	     -739</p>
<p> TOTAL					39,321	   36,810</p>
<p> Operating profit			  1996		  1995</p>
<p> Telecommunications		     2,982		 2,722</p>
<p> Mobile Phones			    1,431		 1,753</p>
<p> Other operations		    loss 147	  profit 537</p>
<p> TOTAL					4,266		 5,012</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
